// AWS IAM User Added to Group  [tier: hunt]  ATT&CK: T1098
// Detects adding an IAM user to a group (AddUserToGroup). Adding a controlled user to a privileged group is a direct escalation path.
// False positives: Routine group membership management.
// Source: rules/privilege-escalation/iam-add-user-to-group.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
eventName =~ "AddUserToGroup" and eventSource =~ "iam.amazonaws.com"
